--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a265629390da5d048b9048e88bfa94cb, type: 3}
  m_Name: Act1Scene20
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  allLines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 87aeb4586b2c7154a8ad18806dcc400e, type: 2}
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: You seem to know a lot about Antonio. Were you at the circus before
      he died?
    dialogueOptions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 271855a0698699a4d97673af62310339, type: 2}
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: Yes, my friend, I was one of the first performers at the circus. I
      love performance and putting on a good show!
    dialogueOptions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 87aeb4586b2c7154a8ad18806dcc400e, type: 2}
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: "I can tell\u2026 So was your act popular?"
    dialogueOptions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 271855a0698699a4d97673af62310339, type: 2}
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: Of course, I was huge at the circus! People would come from all over
      to see me and my wonderful magic acts!
    dialogueOptions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 271855a0698699a4d97673af62310339, type: 2}
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: Now, I was no Antonio, but I filled seats.
    dialogueOptions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 271855a0698699a4d97673af62310339, type: 2}
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: Despite my love for the circus, it was always my dream to move on from
      it and have my own theater, but alas, that day never came.
    dialogueOptions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 87aeb4586b2c7154a8ad18806dcc400e, type: 2}
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: Sorry to hear that.
    dialogueOptions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 271855a0698699a4d97673af62310339, type: 2}
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: "Don\u2019t be, you did nothing wrong, my friend."
    dialogueOptions: []
